ned flawed partially  blind self deceived but ultimately  dignified and quite good human being  struggling against enormous odds  sometimes on a good day  succeeding just a little in a few areas  at the school of life we believe in  developing emotional intelligence to  that end we've also created a whole  range of products to support that growth  find out more at the link on the screen  now
 

